WEBVTT

00:01.250 --> 00:06.290
<b>HOLY GOD CALENDAR YEAR 432, SIDON WASTELANDS-</b>

00:06.290 --> 00:07.830
It's quite the conundrum.

00:08.170 --> 00:13.420
We're short-staffed enough as it is down at the quarry.
We can't afford to have a gargoyle terrorizing us...

00:14.380 --> 00:18.790
But now the Great Hero of the Holy Sword
is coming to our rescue. I truly can't thank you enough.

00:19.670 --> 00:23.210
<b>LEONIS SHEALTO</b>

00:19.670 --> 00:23.210
<b>16 YEARS OLD</b>

00:20.750 --> 00:25.420
The Crown has given me orders
to police this entire region, so I'm merely doing my duty.

00:25.670 --> 00:27.540
You're an honorable man, Sir Leonis.

00:28.130 --> 00:32.130
While the other Six Heroes are busy protecting
the imperial capital and the holy city,

00:32.580 --> 00:35.540
you're out here in the middle of nowhere,
slaying monsters for our sake.

00:37.830 --> 00:40.380
Said monsters make for endearing opponents.

00:40.750 --> 00:44.290
In fact, I think capturing and training one
would be an exciting endeavor.

00:44.920 --> 00:46.630
Surely you jest!

00:46.630 --> 00:50.670
Those sound nothing like the words of the mighty hero
who felled Zol Vadis the Demon Lord.

01:02.750 --> 01:05.460
So, where's this gargoyle?

01:24.170 --> 01:25.210
Don't let him slip away!

01:43.880 --> 01:44.790
Do it!

02:04.830 --> 02:06.250
Good... Bring him down.

02:13.830 --> 02:18.170
Now we no longer need worry about Leonis the Hero
posing a threat to our master.

02:19.040 --> 02:23.540
All that respect he earned from both
the Crown and the masses, gone out the window...

02:23.540 --> 02:27.710
He was spouting some absurd nonsense
about taming monsters. It was a lost cause.

02:29.040 --> 02:33.000
If he'd shown any desire for status or money,
we could've come to some sort of agreement...

02:43.170 --> 02:44.330
How cruel.

02:48.670 --> 02:51.420
Deep down, you must've known it was a trap.

02:52.380 --> 02:53.500
Perhaps...

02:55.210 --> 03:00.040
Regardless, you're the savior of this world,
yet you were murdered by those with power.

03:00.170 --> 03:01.750
Not an uncommon story.

03:02.330 --> 03:06.080
You were betrayed. Don't you hate them for it?

03:06.460 --> 03:11.210
No. It doesn't necessarily mean
that those people are bad or evil.

03:11.960 --> 03:12.750
Really?

03:13.630 --> 03:17.790
Then let me ask this: Do you believe this world is just?

03:18.380 --> 03:19.630
It makes no difference.

03:20.080 --> 03:23.580
In the end, the world was what it was. That's all.

03:23.880 --> 03:25.500
So that's your perspective...

03:26.130 --> 03:33.790
I, on the other hand... have every intention
of rebelling against this world. Will you join me?

03:34.170 --> 03:35.830
Why invite me?

03:36.500 --> 03:38.830
You're the only one I can trust with this matter...

03:39.920 --> 03:41.670
No, that's not why.

03:42.380 --> 03:44.130
I've had my eye on you.

03:46.790 --> 03:49.380
I took a liking to you.

03:50.710 --> 03:52.830
Heroes are boring.

03:53.460 --> 03:56.500
Be mine, Leonis.

04:12.830 --> 04:13.920
Roselia...

04:14.710 --> 04:18.830
Tracking her down and restoring
her Demon Lord Army to its former glory...

04:18.830 --> 04:22.540
That was to be my mission
once I rose from the dead in a thousand years' time...

05:57.880 --> 06:00.710
<b>THE STIRRINGS OF A BITTER GRUDGE</b>

05:59.920 --> 06:02.080
Rise, my minion.

06:06.170 --> 06:08.750
I feel like someone threw a bucket of cold water on me...

06:11.960 --> 06:13.670
This mark denotes authority.

06:14.170 --> 06:17.790
It serves as the counterpart to your mark
of subservience, Miss Selia.

06:18.380 --> 06:22.960
I can use it to force obedience on my minions,
so coaxing you into consciousness is easy.

06:23.380 --> 06:26.080
So you're the one who woke me up, huh?

06:26.080 --> 06:27.670
W-wait a minute!

06:28.080 --> 06:31.500
Does that mean I have to do everything you tell me to...?

06:32.460 --> 06:34.500
D-dirty stuff, too...?

06:34.500 --> 06:36.630
I would never do anything like that.

06:36.630 --> 06:40.080
Oh, that's right...
You behaved like a gentleman in the bath.

06:40.080 --> 06:42.790
Which is why I'd prefer for you to behave like a lady.

06:43.250 --> 06:43.670
Huh?

06:45.210 --> 06:47.960
You drank my blood, didn't you? While I was sleeping.

06:49.210 --> 06:51.040
J-just a little bit...

06:51.290 --> 06:54.170
It was late and I couldn't wait, so I just...

06:54.330 --> 06:56.960
You're my minion, so I don't mind you doing it.

06:57.290 --> 07:00.790
And I'd imagine your bloodlust
is especially difficult to control at night.

07:01.210 --> 07:03.790
But at least say something next time, okay?

07:03.790 --> 07:06.080
Okay, I understand. Sorry.

07:10.080 --> 07:10.830
Hello?

07:11.040 --> 07:14.460
Good morning, Finé. Everything okay?

07:14.790 --> 07:18.710
Something's been bothering me,
and as our captain, I figured you might be interested.

07:18.880 --> 07:19.710
What is it?

07:20.040 --> 07:22.420
They called for a strategy meeting a little while ago.

07:22.830 --> 07:25.040
At this hour? On our day off?

07:25.040 --> 07:28.540
I don't know what it's about, but I'd guess
it has something to do with the research team.

07:28.920 --> 07:30.790
The ones who went out on the marine survey, right?

07:31.420 --> 07:34.580
They haven't uploaded their investigation
results to the database.

07:34.580 --> 07:37.540
This early-morning strategy meeting
can't be a coindidence...

07:38.830 --> 07:41.710
Anyway, if I hear anything, I'll let you know ASAP.

07:41.710 --> 07:43.880
Sounds good. Feel free to call me anytime.

07:44.580 --> 07:45.960
Did something happen?

07:46.130 --> 07:48.250
Yeah... But I'm sure it'll be fine.

07:48.710 --> 07:54.500
More importantly, Leo... I don't have any classes today,
so I want you to whip me into shape!

07:55.040 --> 07:59.500
You had a nice midnight snack
and now you're ready to get your energy out, is that it?

08:00.170 --> 08:02.170
Don't tease me like that...!

08:09.960 --> 08:15.080
Approximately eleven hours ago, communications with
the 13th Platoon ceased in the vicinity of Anchor No. 4.

08:15.330 --> 08:19.710
<b>ACTING COMMANDER OF THE SEVENTH ASSAULT GARDEN</b>

08:15.330 --> 08:19.710
<b>CASTOROS NEKEO</b>

08:17.710 --> 08:19.040
They're all dead...?

08:19.710 --> 08:24.500
<b>CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD</b>

08:19.710 --> 08:24.500
<b>VITE LEONE</b>

08:19.710 --> 08:24.500
<b>MILITARY ADVISOR</b>

08:19.710 --> 08:24.500
<b>BALDUR VALERY</b>

08:20.080 --> 08:23.500
The commander spends half the year
at the imperial captial on official business,

08:23.790 --> 08:27.790
and yet these irksome dilemmas
always seem to occur in his absense.

08:28.330 --> 08:30.960
According to the data we received
just prior to losing their signal,

08:30.960 --> 08:34.580
Void activity was detected,
but it disappeared after three seconds.

08:34.830 --> 08:40.250
<b>DIVISIONAL COMMANDER</b>

08:34.830 --> 08:40.250
<b>GUYLIAN COOPER</b>

08:34.960 --> 08:40.500
It's not unusual for Voids to vanish or crystallize
after running amok... but three seconds is far too quick.

08:40.790 --> 08:42.540
Could the sensors be malfunctioning?

08:42.540 --> 08:46.750
Changes in spatial mass and mana waveform
characteristics... Sensors appear to be measuring both.

08:47.000 --> 08:47.790
We've got images, too.

08:48.670 --> 08:51.210
They're from an underwater data link, so they're blurry...

08:52.130 --> 08:53.880
Like the roots of a tree...

08:53.960 --> 08:57.000
I cross-referenced it against our library
but found no corresponding vegetation.

08:57.580 --> 08:59.210
A new species of Void?

08:59.210 --> 09:02.630
There's a possibility it's some sort
of mutated Void or Void Lord.

09:03.000 --> 09:05.750
A Void Lord, you say? Have you any evidence?

09:05.960 --> 09:07.420
It's purely conjecture.

09:07.630 --> 09:09.580
And synonymous with a Stampede.

09:10.000 --> 09:14.960
We mustn't forget the tragedy that happened six years
ago when they attacked the Third Assault Garden.

09:15.380 --> 09:19.790
Mr. Advisor... the memory of said tragedy
is the reason we've drastically enhanced

09:19.790 --> 09:24.210
the Seventh Assault Garden's defensive capabilities,
as well as prioritized the training of our Holy Swordsmen.

09:24.580 --> 09:26.750
It's all for the sake of exacting revenge.

09:27.250 --> 09:31.330
And us civilians have made it a habit
to practice our drills on a regular basis.

09:31.580 --> 09:34.630
We can evacuate to the shelter calmly,
even during an emergency.

09:34.920 --> 09:38.920
The demi-human ward is rife with dissidents
who scorn the empire's rule, is it not?

09:39.420 --> 09:42.580
Can you be absolutely certain
they won't attempt to induce panic?

09:43.080 --> 09:46.710
If there's a possibility of a Stampede,
why not move the city ahead of time?

09:47.130 --> 09:52.210
The power plant's output is holding stable at about ninety
percent. Withdrawing would be feasible at thirty knots.

09:52.540 --> 09:54.750
I can't agree with such a passive approach.

09:54.960 --> 09:58.880
An Assault Garden's seafaring abilities
aren't meant for running away from Voids.

09:59.290 --> 09:59.790
Yes?

10:03.290 --> 10:04.880
Right, got it.

10:06.420 --> 10:08.000
The commander made his decision.

10:08.250 --> 10:10.790
Since Void activity is no longer present at this time,

10:10.790 --> 10:14.080
discussions of a mode shift
or relocating to different waters are premature.

10:14.540 --> 10:16.460
He's ordering an immediate follow-up investigation.

10:16.710 --> 10:17.580
Understood.

10:17.920 --> 10:20.880
I'll assemble a reconnaissance-in-force squadron
made up of our top three platoons.

10:21.330 --> 10:24.080
If the Void horde is small,
we might even be able to eliminate it.

10:24.250 --> 10:27.290
I've assigned the target designation code "UK6402,"

10:27.500 --> 10:29.670
and I'm entering the details
into the imperial capital's database.

10:30.130 --> 10:31.880
Be on the lookout for crystals.

10:32.290 --> 10:33.330
I'm well aware.

10:33.540 --> 10:38.540
I've yet to allow a single Void to infiltrate this city.
And I don't intend to let that change.

10:39.080 --> 10:43.290
Just in case, I'll instruct our Holy Swordsmen
with scouting expertise to gather intel.

10:43.380 --> 10:44.130
Good.

10:57.630 --> 10:58.210
Take this!

11:03.790 --> 11:05.750
Pretty impressive technique.

11:07.330 --> 11:08.960
You know about sword fighting?

11:09.790 --> 11:11.290
Um, kind of...

11:11.750 --> 11:14.750
Did you take lessons with an instructor, Miss Selia?

11:14.750 --> 11:17.040
I learned from my family when I was little.

11:17.420 --> 11:22.380
I've been self-taught ever since coming to the academy...
but I can't hold a candle to someone like Sakuya.

11:22.380 --> 11:23.960
She's a real master.

11:24.330 --> 11:27.790
A Vampire Queen's enormous mana supply
is where her true potential lies.

11:28.000 --> 11:29.670
I'll teach you sorcery one of these days, too.

11:30.040 --> 11:30.880
Really?

11:30.880 --> 11:31.580
Sure.

11:31.830 --> 11:33.830
I think our best course of action

11:33.960 --> 11:37.920
would be to harness your sword skills, use your mana to
strengthen your physique, and turn you into a spellblade.

11:38.960 --> 11:39.920
Let's do it!

11:40.170 --> 11:43.210
Okay then. I'll prepare some more
practical opponents for you.

11:47.210 --> 11:49.460
Dauntless soldiers of the underworld...

11:50.130 --> 11:53.710
Come forth and answer the call of the Undead King.

11:54.630 --> 11:58.080
Wh-what are those? Skeletons...?

11:59.580 --> 12:01.080
They're my lowest ranked minions.

12:01.580 --> 12:02.580
Seriously?

12:02.790 --> 12:06.080
Have young people these days
never seen a skeleton before...?

12:06.580 --> 12:08.460
Feel free to really let loose on them.

12:09.170 --> 12:11.250
In that case... I won't hold back!

12:20.580 --> 12:22.130
Hope you're ready for a second wave.

12:22.420 --> 12:23.130
Yeah!

12:26.630 --> 12:27.420
Take that!

12:37.920 --> 12:39.710
I think we can call it a day.

12:47.670 --> 12:49.170
Thank you very much!

12:49.170 --> 12:51.000
Shall we top off your mana supply?

12:51.000 --> 12:52.830
No, I-I'm good...

12:54.380 --> 12:58.080
Seems like you're getting the hang
of fighting with your new body.

12:58.330 --> 13:02.040
I've still got a ways to go,
but even I can tell I'm stronger than before.

13:02.250 --> 13:03.580
And it's 'cause of you, Leo!

13:04.210 --> 13:06.830
I love to see my minions improving and getting stronger.

13:07.040 --> 13:12.290
Let me treat you to a meal as thanks for the training
session. I know this great little restaurant off campus!

13:12.630 --> 13:15.830
I can't keep asking you to fork over
your money all the time...

13:18.330 --> 13:21.380
This body is utterly ridiculous, I swear...

13:24.330 --> 13:26.460
Alpha Company, when you arrive at the designated site,

13:26.460 --> 13:29.710
target UK6402 and commence
the reconnaissance mission.

13:35.960 --> 13:37.420
Alpha One, copy.

13:49.540 --> 13:51.330
Been a while since I actually won...

13:51.330 --> 13:53.630
Nothing makes me happier than free bets!

13:53.630 --> 13:54.210
Huh?

14:07.170 --> 14:11.460
What a beautiful coat you have... And such a noble aura!

14:12.130 --> 14:15.790
No collar... Which means you probably
don't belong to anyone.

14:16.290 --> 14:20.920
Okay! I think I'll name you "Mr. Fluffy-wuffy Black Fur"!

14:22.920 --> 14:25.420
Aw, you really like it, don't you?

14:28.040 --> 14:30.920
Bought that with my casino winnings, so enjoy, alright?

14:31.170 --> 14:32.880
You can eat it if you get hungry.

14:34.080 --> 14:36.710
Until we meet again, Mr. Fluffy-wuffy Black Fur!

14:40.290 --> 14:41.080
Come in.

14:42.250 --> 14:43.500
Sorry for interrupting!

14:45.250 --> 14:48.500
I'm making sweet potato rolls.
Can you taste the batter for me?

14:48.670 --> 14:49.920
You're hard at work, I see.

14:49.920 --> 14:54.880
Well, it's our day off. I figured, "Why not try and knock
the kid's socks off with some fancy-schmancy treats?"

14:56.380 --> 14:58.170
Mmm, it's perfect.

14:58.630 --> 14:59.380
Good!

14:59.830 --> 15:00.580
Come in.

15:01.540 --> 15:02.710
Hey, get this!

15:02.880 --> 15:05.920
I just met the most regal-looking dog
out in front of the dorm!

15:06.290 --> 15:08.460
His name is Mr. Fluffy-wuffy Black Fur.

15:08.460 --> 15:12.460
Fitting, given his gorgeous coat.
He and I are totally friends now.

15:12.880 --> 15:16.790
In other words, you happened across a stray dog
and thought it'd be fun to give him a name?

15:17.080 --> 15:18.880
Be sure not to feed him, okay?

15:19.330 --> 15:21.380
I'll have to introduce you guys next time.

15:22.170 --> 15:23.670
Is that fresh out of the oven?

15:23.790 --> 15:26.250
It's a work in progress, but you're welcome to taste it.

15:26.330 --> 15:29.880
Oh, thank goodness!
I haven't eaten anything since last night.

15:30.540 --> 15:32.250
There's some tea in the teapot.

15:32.500 --> 15:33.460
Much appreciated.

15:34.170 --> 15:38.750
By the way, Elfiné, why are you wearing your uniform?
We don't have classes today...

15:38.750 --> 15:42.000
Just as a precaution.
So that I'm ready whenever our teacher calls.

15:42.000 --> 15:42.630
Huh?

15:42.830 --> 15:45.330
I've been tasked with gathering and analyzing intel.

15:45.880 --> 15:51.290
The platoon that went on the marine survey hasn't come
back, so they've got a recon squad headed out there.

15:51.710 --> 15:53.000
Was it Voids?

15:53.000 --> 15:54.170
Not sure yet.

15:54.170 --> 15:55.830
Any idea what Selia's up to?

15:55.830 --> 15:58.880
Doing what she always does
in the afternoons on our days off.

16:19.960 --> 16:25.420
Now that I look around...
human civilization really is remarkable.

16:33.210 --> 16:37.380
I have to work hard and earn money,
or else I won't be able to buy sweets for my master.

16:38.210 --> 16:39.210
Hey, newbie!

16:39.670 --> 16:41.920
Can you handle prepping
the ingredients for French fries?

16:41.920 --> 16:43.040
I can do anything.

16:43.040 --> 16:45.920
Then cut these up. You can use that knife.

16:48.170 --> 16:51.460
This knife looks dull... I'll use my own knife instead.

16:51.830 --> 16:52.330
Huh?

17:01.920 --> 17:02.630
Wha...?

17:03.250 --> 17:06.420
What are you doing?!
And what the heck do you call THAT?!

17:06.420 --> 17:08.080
I simply did as you requested...

17:08.580 --> 17:10.830
Fine! Just... go sweep the sidewalk out front!

17:24.250 --> 17:25.330
Wait here for a second.

17:28.130 --> 17:29.460
Welcome, Miss!

17:29.750 --> 17:33.630
I'll take standard yeast and glazed crullers.
Ten of each, please.

17:37.040 --> 17:37.920
Hold onto these.

17:38.380 --> 17:40.540
No snacking, okay? They're a gift for someone.

17:41.000 --> 17:43.500
She's dangling donuts in front of the Demon Lord?!

17:43.880 --> 17:46.250
Master is far too lenient with his minions...

17:49.790 --> 17:53.710
Donuts aside, I wonder where those two are going...

17:59.830 --> 18:01.380
"Sunny Spot House."

18:01.790 --> 18:04.290
Is this the restaurant you were talking about?

18:04.460 --> 18:05.380
That's right!

18:06.460 --> 18:07.500
Let's head inside.

18:07.500 --> 18:08.750
Hiya, Big Sis!

18:08.880 --> 18:10.250
It's Big Sis Selia!

18:10.250 --> 18:11.250
Hey, Selia!

18:12.630 --> 18:14.630
W-wait, what's going on?!

18:14.790 --> 18:16.630
These kiddos call this place home.

18:16.630 --> 18:18.250
But it's a restaurant, too.

18:18.460 --> 18:20.630
I work here part-time every now and then.

18:18.460 --> 18:19.830
What's in the box?

18:19.830 --> 18:21.290
They're some kind of groceries, right?

18:21.630 --> 18:24.920
A couple of them are close to your age, Leo.
So be nice, okay?

18:26.750 --> 18:29.080
They're orphans... just like me.

18:37.790 --> 18:39.830
We went on a field trip the other day!

18:39.830 --> 18:42.170
How exciting! Where'd you go?

18:42.330 --> 18:43.540
The outer part of the city.

18:43.540 --> 18:44.880
That's a long walk!

18:43.540 --> 18:45.920
Their lives are very different than mine was...

18:47.130 --> 18:51.540
Your name's Leo, right? Big Sis Selia's friend?

18:56.580 --> 19:00.330
We were sad 'cause you
haven't come over to play in so long!

19:00.580 --> 19:03.670
I'm sorry. I was busy studying for my midterms and-

19:05.630 --> 19:07.580
Now that I CAN'T ignore...!

19:10.790 --> 19:13.290
It's alright. He's still just a little kid.

19:15.170 --> 19:17.250
Perhaps I got a bit too overzealous...

19:19.210 --> 19:21.500
Dean, that's enough with the pranks.

19:21.960 --> 19:23.330
I'm not doing anything!

19:23.330 --> 19:25.040
Hello, Miss Phrenia!

19:25.750 --> 19:28.210
Miss Phrenia is the owner of this place.

19:28.580 --> 19:30.710
Welcome. And who's this?

19:30.710 --> 19:34.420
He's the boy I found at the ruins.
Leo is a Holy Swordsman.

19:35.710 --> 19:36.830
For real?!

19:37.420 --> 19:38.380
How cool!

19:38.670 --> 19:40.790
Seriously, Leo? That's awesome!

19:41.210 --> 19:42.880
S-stop that...!

19:43.080 --> 19:45.080
I brought some vegetables from our dorm's garden.

19:45.630 --> 19:47.080
Thank you as always.

19:47.460 --> 19:50.040
Also, I picked up some donuts on my way over.

19:50.290 --> 19:51.290
Donuts?!

19:51.290 --> 19:52.080
Hooray!

19:52.080 --> 19:53.880
I haven't had a donut in forever...

19:55.330 --> 19:56.250
Let's eat!

19:56.250 --> 19:59.290
Alright, alright. Everyone can have
a donut at snack time later.

19:59.790 --> 20:02.960
Selia, you're cooking a meal for us today, right?

20:03.420 --> 20:04.500
Of course!

20:04.500 --> 20:05.790
Yay!

20:05.790 --> 20:06.790
I get it...

20:07.630 --> 20:10.580
This is a place that Riselia wants to protect.

20:12.210 --> 20:14.290
A place to protect...

20:16.130 --> 20:18.330
I don't have one anymore...

20:25.080 --> 20:26.540
There's nothing here.

20:26.540 --> 20:28.250
Guess it must've crystallized already.

20:45.830 --> 20:47.960
Vibrations beneath the city's outer rim...?

20:50.460 --> 20:51.500
But that's...

20:53.330 --> 20:55.040
Sweet potato rolls are done!

20:55.920 --> 20:57.210
Is something the matter?

20:58.830 --> 21:00.830
Why do I feel uneasy...?

21:01.880 --> 21:05.130
But we checked the food reserves
just last month, didn't we?

21:05.580 --> 21:06.710
Quit complaining.

21:06.880 --> 21:08.290
The board requested it.

21:13.960 --> 21:15.500
What is all this...?

21:25.080 --> 21:26.170
Yummy!

21:26.880 --> 21:28.630
Is it time for donuts?

21:28.960 --> 21:31.210
Donuts are sweets, so not yet.

23:12.000 --> 23:13.750
We've got 25 seconds this time!

23:13.750 --> 23:15.210
So a little more breathing room.

23:15.500 --> 23:17.290
I'll be giving a lecture on the duties of a maid.

23:17.790 --> 23:20.420
Greet 'em with a "Welcome home, Master!"

23:20.790 --> 23:22.630
We charge for Polaroids, so take a whole bunch.

23:22.630 --> 23:23.210
Huh?

23:23.750 --> 23:25.670
Then we draw a cute picture on their omurice.

23:25.670 --> 23:27.630
Lastly, we cast a spell.

23:27.630 --> 23:32.250
"Rise! Rise! Obey my black magic and rise,
souls of the damned..."

23:33.630 --> 23:35.420
"See you next time, Master!"

23:46.960 --> 23:51.040
<b>A GREAT UPROAR</b>
